OL,3,GNEWSAPolice station used in riots a
OL,4,Asteal at #99k, auctioneers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn imposing police station in a town
OL,7,Fknown for historic Welsh riots is being
OL,8,Fsold at auction complete with its
OL,9,F"impregnable cells", auctioneers have
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe Tonypandy Riots of 1910 happened in
OL,13,FRhondda Cynon Taf after miners went on
OL,14,Fstrike following a disagreement with
OL,15,Fpit owners, leading to shops in the
OL,16,Ftown being wrecked and extra police and
OL,17,Fmilitary called in.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
