OL,3,GNEWSAPolice station used in riots a
OL,4,Asteal at #99k, auctioneers say
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Many of those caught up in the
OL,7,Fdisturbances are believed to have been
OL,8,Farrested by police officers and
OL,9,Fmilitary personnel operating from the
OL,10,FTonypandy police station," said Paul
OL,11,FFosh Auctions.
OL,13,FThe sprawling two-storey building,
OL,14,Fbuilt in 1876, could be a "steal", it
OL,15,Fsaid, with a guide price of #99,000.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
